# Mirrors .gitignore, plus .git/ itself - keeps the build context small and
# avoids ever baking local secrets/dev artifacts into the image.
#
# ENFORCED, not aspirational (2026-09-23, audit pass): this file once claimed
# to mirror .gitignore while missing `*.sqlite3.*` - the exact pattern added
# to .gitignore after dev_smoke_test.sqlite3.bak_pre_vendorgate (real bcrypt
# hashes + emails) got committed. That backup would have been baked into any
# image built here. apps/api/tests/test_dockerignore_mirrors_gitignore.py now
# fails if .gitignore has a pattern this file does not. Add new patterns to
# BOTH files.
.git/

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env
staticfiles/
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3.*
.pytest_cache/
logs/
_a11y_tmp/

.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
